<!--
  DRAFT (2.4.n Pattern B) — Loxone → Earnie heatpump telemetry push.
  Freigabe is on VI_Earnie_Heatpump. Power may be EFM Load — keep VO cmd.
  VO path: flex.{hk_id}.sens_power_act — default hk_id waermepumpe (rename if HK id differs).
  Binding key flex.{hk_id}.sens_power_act. Legacy Title Earnie_WP_P_act still valid.
  Heat storage temps (2.7.b): T_eq + T_low on thermal_annual ehal_bindings (not flex.*).
  Value placeholder in a Virtual Output command is <v> (verified 2026-10-07 with a capture: the Virtual-Input style \v is sent as the
  control character 0x0B). <v> arrives with a point and 3 decimals (e.g. 6.333). In the XML attribute it is written &lt;v&gt;.
  Pilot (branch spike/vo-push-pilot): target is the daemon port 8541 (not the Streamlit port 8501); append ?t=TOKEN to the command
  (EARNIE_PILOT_PUSH_TOKEN). Repeat (e.g. 30 s) is set per command in Config.
-->
<VirtualOut HintText="" Title="Earnie Wärmepumpe Telemetry" Comment="Pattern B: push WP power + heat-storage temps to Earnie (draft)" Address="http://EARNIE_HOST:8541" CmdInit="" CloseAfterSend="true" CmdSep="">
